OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrested in hunt for
OL,4,Aabsconded child rapists
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been re-arrested as
OL,7,Fpolice search for two convicted
OL,8,FBradford sex offenders who absconded
OL,9,Fduring their trial.
OL,11,FBrothers Fayaz and Imtiaz Ahmed were
OL,12,Fsentenced in their absence in January
OL,13,F2025 for raping a girl in Keighley in
OL,14,Fthe 1990s, when she was 13 or 14.
OL,16,FFayaz Ahmed, who was 45 at the time of
OL,17,Fthe hearing, was sentenced to seven and
OL,18,Fa half years in prison for two counts
OL,19,Fof rape. Imtiaz Ahmed, who was 62, was
OL,20,Fjailed for nine years for one count of
OL,21,Frape.
